{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>印度東部發生人踩人事故，至少17死、25傷。</p><p></p><p>事發在西孟加拉邦首府加爾各答。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.IND.STAMPEDE-0400.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mi8NK2du671792273217.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>當地傳媒報道，周六晚有大批民眾出席印度教節日慶祝活動，期間突然下大雨，部分民眾為避雨而匆忙離開現場。現場出入口非常狹窄，照明不足，他們不斷推撞導致有人跌倒，之後引觸人踩人，其中一名死者是7歲女孩。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.IND.STAMPEDE-0400_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bhSiGHEnHo1792273213.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>總理莫迪形容事件是悲劇，強調當局會協助遇難者家屬。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T22:18:51.938878+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T00:17:36.071374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T22:17:35.592040+00:00","content_hash":"1efadf591e99cc572c4775de04aa8745e09cd8306bd33787a104faa2e8d1d873","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}